        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Gontier, Björk, Cale Gontier\n- Bands and Albums: Art of Dying, Saint Asonia, Three Days Grace, Vices and Virtues\n\nFacts:\n- Björk Guðmundsdóttir was born on 21 November 1965 and is an Icelandic singer, songwriter, actress, record producer, and DJ.\n- Adam Wade Gontier was born on May 25, 1978 and is a Canadian singer, songwriter, and musician.\n- Adam Gontier was the former lead singer of Three Days Grace and became the lead singer of Saint Asonia.\n- Cale Gontier is the bassist of Art of Dying and the cousin of Adam Gontier.\n- Vices and Virtues is the second studio album by the Canadian rock band Art of Dying.",
